._*
Thumbs.db

# Unity3D build and crash artefacts
sysinfo.txt
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app
crashlytics-build.properties
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*
ExportedObj/
*.stackdump

# Agent tooling, not part of the game. Kept on the machine that uses it: Unity loads a
# folder under Packages/ as an embedded package without any manifest entry, so this stays
# working locally while never reaching a clone.
Packages/com.coplaydev.unity-mcp/

# Reference frames rendered by TTCaptureShots
_shots3d/

# probe output from headless verification runs
_probe/
_STATUS.md
